\newlabel{fig:heatmap_gpt4}{{4}{12}{GPT-4 Coupling Matrix. Heatmap of phi coefficients for all 10 dimension pairs. Dominant truthfulness-robustness coupling (phi 0.62) illustrates sparse coupling pattern}{figure.4}{}}
